WEBVTT

01:49.120 --> 01:50.960
I need to ask you
and Su Chengcheng a favor.

01:52.040 --> 01:52.960
Go ahead.

01:55.200 --> 01:57.160
Help me keep Uncle and Aunt

01:58.120 --> 02:00.800
from mentioning the baby to Yuan.

02:01.680 --> 02:02.920
Pretend you know nothing.

02:03.560 --> 02:05.200
Don't put pressure on her.

02:10.280 --> 02:12.880
I thought you wanted Uncle and Aunt

02:12.960 --> 02:15.080
to convince Lin Yuan to keep the baby.

02:18.160 --> 02:19.160
I did consider that.

02:20.840 --> 02:23.120
But after thinking it through last night…

02:24.160 --> 02:26.040
Yuan's already under great pressure.

02:26.120 --> 02:28.960
I can't let her make hasty decisions

02:29.040 --> 02:30.120
under more stress.

02:30.840 --> 02:32.040
That would backfire.

02:38.120 --> 02:39.360
We'll do our best.

02:39.440 --> 02:42.120
We should buy you some time.

02:45.760 --> 02:46.600
Thanks.

02:50.240 --> 02:51.400
You really want this child.

02:56.320 --> 02:57.240
Of course.

02:58.000 --> 03:01.600
Chengcheng said you promised

03:02.840 --> 03:03.880
to respect Lin Yuan's decision.

03:05.120 --> 03:06.800
I will respect her choice.

03:08.320 --> 03:10.960
But I can still proactively

03:11.560 --> 03:12.880
influence her decision.

03:21.240 --> 03:22.400
May you succeed.

03:26.920 --> 03:29.360
That sounded a bit odd, but not wrong.

03:35.200 --> 03:36.880
Alright, I'm leaving.

04:13.400 --> 04:15.560
You seem to be doing quite well
on your own.

04:36.400 --> 04:38.680
I feel myself hanging in mid-air,

04:38.760 --> 04:39.920
neither up nor down,

04:40.000 --> 04:41.400
unable to do anything.

04:44.680 --> 04:46.160
I have to make a decision.

04:56.240 --> 04:57.880
I hope you didn't skip work today

04:57.960 --> 05:00.080
just because you found out I'm pregnant,

05:00.160 --> 05:01.520
coming here to show me some warmth.

05:02.920 --> 05:04.240
No.

05:04.320 --> 05:05.640
I have an urgent task,

05:05.720 --> 05:06.640
and I need your help.

05:06.720 --> 05:08.000
That's why I came here.

05:09.480 --> 05:12.200
We're opening our first physical store.

05:13.400 --> 05:14.240
I've heard about it.

05:14.840 --> 05:16.360
Tang wants to do a themed promotion

05:16.440 --> 05:17.800
using blush, or rouge,

05:17.880 --> 05:19.200
on the opening day.

05:19.280 --> 05:20.120
Here's the information.

05:29.960 --> 05:32.760
PLUM DYE, ROBUS WHITE, FALLING CHESTNUT
SUO, LIGHT PERSIMMON, AZALEA

05:33.960 --> 05:35.560
The names are beautiful.

05:35.640 --> 05:36.960
What do you want me to do?

05:37.880 --> 05:41.000
You can see that the plant illustrations
for each rouge above

05:41.080 --> 05:42.480
were all found online.

05:43.080 --> 05:44.960
The styles and formats are inconsistent.

05:45.640 --> 05:46.840
We'd like you to help us

05:46.920 --> 05:49.080
draw botanical illustrations
for all the rouges.

05:50.360 --> 05:53.160
They need to be true to the actual plants
and have a Chinese aesthetic.

05:53.760 --> 05:56.360
And the artistic style
should be consistent.

05:56.440 --> 05:59.040
Ideally, after the artistic processing,

05:59.120 --> 06:00.960
they can reflect the mood of each name.

06:01.040 --> 06:02.880
In simple terms…

06:02.960 --> 06:03.840
Got it.

06:03.920 --> 06:06.040
For example, Plum Dye can just be

06:06.120 --> 06:08.320
plum blossoms. It has to be Plum Dye.

06:08.400 --> 06:09.320
Yes,

06:09.920 --> 06:10.840
exactly.

06:11.640 --> 06:14.960
We're short on time,
and the requirements are high.

06:15.040 --> 06:17.800
Hiring a random artist online

06:17.880 --> 06:19.040
wouldn't be reliable.

06:19.120 --> 06:20.760
That's why I thought of you.

06:20.840 --> 06:22.960
I need your help.

06:25.280 --> 06:27.160
This job isn't too hard,

06:27.240 --> 06:28.560
but not too simple either.

06:28.640 --> 06:31.880
With creativity, it can be done quickly.

06:33.000 --> 06:36.080
My own work's hit a rut lately.

06:37.680 --> 06:39.320
I can help with your project!

06:39.920 --> 06:42.960
I can provide
all kinds of creative materials.

06:45.040 --> 06:47.200
I didn't say I wouldn't help. Relax.

06:47.280 --> 06:48.840
I meant

06:48.920 --> 06:51.520
since I'm having a creative block,

06:52.120 --> 06:54.160
taking side jobs could refresh my mood.

06:57.400 --> 06:59.080
It's perfect that you'd like to help.

06:59.680 --> 07:02.240
I'll whip up something in the kitchen.

07:02.320 --> 07:04.640
You brainstorm first.
See if any ideas come up.

07:04.720 --> 07:05.560
Okay.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.880
FALLING CHESTNUT

07:23.680 --> 07:26.160
- Yuan, dinner's ready.
- Coming.

07:27.560 --> 07:29.120
I just used whatever was in the fridge.

07:37.040 --> 07:38.920
Here, try it.

07:39.000 --> 07:40.840
You really just threw something together.

07:40.920 --> 07:42.480
Just try it first.

07:43.680 --> 07:45.560
You can even make fried rice with seaweed?

07:49.720 --> 07:51.600
- How is it?
- Pretty good.

07:53.280 --> 07:55.480
This is called mixed fried rice.

07:55.560 --> 07:57.040
It's the first dish I ever learned.

07:57.720 --> 08:00.320
Let me think… I could make it
when I was seven.

08:01.840 --> 08:04.840
How could your parents
let you cook so early?

08:08.000 --> 08:10.680
When I was six,
my dad passed away from liver cancer.

08:11.440 --> 08:13.520
My mom worked at the hydropower plant,

08:13.600 --> 08:15.120
working three shifts a day.

08:15.200 --> 08:16.760
She had to be both mom and dad.

08:16.840 --> 08:18.600
To make sure I didn't go hungry,

08:18.680 --> 08:20.000
she taught me how to make this

08:20.080 --> 08:21.760
when I was really young.

08:24.400 --> 08:25.320
I…

08:26.680 --> 08:28.080
I didn't know.

08:29.000 --> 08:31.400
You didn't ask, so I never brought it up.

08:36.440 --> 08:38.720
Don't get me wrong, my mom spoiled me.

08:38.799 --> 08:39.880
I didn't suffer much.

08:40.480 --> 08:41.960
At first,

08:42.039 --> 08:44.880
my mom would chop all the vegetables

08:44.960 --> 08:47.560
and put them on a small plate for me.

08:47.640 --> 08:50.640
When I got home,
I'd just put the rice, eggs,

08:50.720 --> 08:52.160
and the pre-chopped veggies

08:52.240 --> 08:53.960
into the pan and stir-fry them.

08:54.600 --> 08:56.840
Later,

08:56.920 --> 08:59.200
when I could chop vegetables myself,

08:59.280 --> 09:01.360
she stopped preparing anything.

09:01.440 --> 09:02.360
She just left it to me,

09:02.440 --> 09:04.440
letting me put in whatever I wanted.

09:05.720 --> 09:09.720
Did your mom remarry later?

09:10.360 --> 09:11.240
No.

09:12.360 --> 09:14.200
She said she was too busy,

09:16.040 --> 09:18.120
too overwhelmed taking care of us all.

09:18.720 --> 09:20.280
She didn't want to marry again

09:20.360 --> 09:21.440
and care for another man.

09:22.840 --> 09:24.160
All of you?

09:25.440 --> 09:27.200
Oh, she adored pets.

09:27.280 --> 09:30.560
Back then, she was the sole breadwinner.

09:30.640 --> 09:33.040
We still kept a cat,

09:33.120 --> 09:34.000
a dog,

09:34.640 --> 09:36.680
two parrots, and a tank of fish.

09:37.320 --> 09:38.720
We even had a chicken once.

09:39.400 --> 09:41.360
A relative gave us eggs
from the countryside,

09:41.440 --> 09:43.880
and a chick hatched unexpectedly.

09:43.960 --> 09:44.800
So, we raised it.

09:45.480 --> 09:47.640
No wonder you love animals so much.

09:47.720 --> 09:49.040
You take after your mom.

09:51.720 --> 09:54.600
Mom says I take after my dad.

09:56.040 --> 09:58.960
She first noticed him

09:59.040 --> 10:00.960
when he nursed a bird

10:01.040 --> 10:03.040
with a hurt leg.

10:04.040 --> 10:06.760
People at the factory said
wild things couldn't survive,

10:06.840 --> 10:08.120
but my dad saved it anyway.

10:09.920 --> 10:11.680
After my mom retired,

10:11.760 --> 10:14.200
she opened a pet store with a friend.

10:15.280 --> 10:17.960
I didn't take you there earlier

10:18.040 --> 10:19.720
to avoid making you nervous.

10:20.240 --> 10:21.360
Instead, I took you

10:21.440 --> 10:23.800
to the shops run by her friends.

10:30.520 --> 10:34.320
Next time, if you're willing,

10:35.520 --> 10:37.200
how about visiting my mom's shop?

10:42.640 --> 10:44.880
I know why you're telling me all this.

10:47.560 --> 10:49.240
You want me to keep the baby.

10:54.840 --> 10:55.680
I…

11:23.680 --> 11:24.520
I think…

11:29.320 --> 11:30.160
I feel like…

11:31.560 --> 11:33.280
we can try to embrace a new life

11:34.160 --> 11:35.680
full of warmth and love.

11:37.600 --> 11:39.160
Marriage won't become our burden.

11:42.960 --> 11:43.920
I believe

11:47.360 --> 11:49.280
you'll definitely be a great mom.

11:51.960 --> 11:53.840
And I'll work hard to be a good dad.

11:57.680 --> 11:58.520
And my mom,

12:01.760 --> 12:03.640
she'll definitely be a great grandma.

12:06.440 --> 12:07.280
The baby…

12:08.040 --> 12:10.240
will be loved by so many people.

12:13.480 --> 12:15.360
It'll definitely have a happy childhood.

12:27.520 --> 12:28.360
Yuan.

12:39.360 --> 12:40.400
Gu Yu.

12:48.000 --> 12:48.960
I've made up my mind.

12:56.040 --> 12:58.080
I've decided to keep the baby.

13:00.840 --> 13:01.920
I'm glad that I met you.

13:02.760 --> 13:04.520
You've made me feel loved.

13:05.320 --> 13:07.160
I want to bravely take this step.

13:08.960 --> 13:10.560
I want a family.

13:15.760 --> 13:17.640
I'll love the baby so, so much.

13:18.880 --> 13:20.960
And it'll love me so, so much too.

13:29.040 --> 13:30.280
Don't cry, okay?

13:32.240 --> 13:33.160
You're not as pretty.

13:44.760 --> 13:46.440
I'll love you so, so much,

13:48.440 --> 13:49.760
and the baby too.

13:52.560 --> 13:54.040
I want to meet your mom.

13:55.400 --> 13:56.720
Let's go to her shop.

13:58.120 --> 13:58.960
Okay.

14:49.160 --> 14:50.320
What did you buy?

14:50.920 --> 14:52.880
Why wouldn't you let me go buy it?
You made me wait here.

14:53.400 --> 14:54.320
Sit down.

14:59.960 --> 15:00.840
Okay.

15:01.560 --> 15:02.400
I'm sitting.

15:02.920 --> 15:05.040
Please focus

15:05.120 --> 15:07.360
on drinking your coffee.

15:13.440 --> 15:16.200
Aren't you a good student?
Don't you know what focus means?

15:19.600 --> 15:20.920
I do.

15:22.960 --> 15:24.680
Stare at your toes. Don't look around.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.280
Don't turn back.

15:38.080 --> 15:38.960
Okay.

15:54.200 --> 15:56.040
So, you went to buy beer?

15:57.000 --> 15:58.440
It's not like I won't let you drink.

15:58.520 --> 16:00.640
Why so sneaky and secretive?

16:00.720 --> 16:02.920
Didn't I tell you not to turn back?
Turn around.

16:03.600 --> 16:04.600
Fine, fine.

16:15.200 --> 16:16.800
Hey, want a can?

16:16.880 --> 16:18.800
I have work in the afternoon.

16:18.880 --> 16:20.960
A sip is fine, but not a whole can.

16:21.560 --> 16:22.640
No, no.

16:22.720 --> 16:26.040
At this moment,
you should act like you heard nothing.

16:26.120 --> 16:27.240
Don't turn back at all.

16:27.320 --> 16:30.680
Then coldly pick up your coffee and drink.

16:33.640 --> 16:34.920
After that, I'd say,

16:35.680 --> 16:37.760
the stuff in our bags is the same.

16:37.840 --> 16:39.320
Just a stack of resumes.

16:39.400 --> 16:40.720
We're in the same boat, huh?

16:50.680 --> 16:52.120
Hey, want a can?

17:07.880 --> 17:08.800
That day…

17:10.680 --> 17:11.839
It was you?

17:13.160 --> 17:14.839
Yeah, it was me.

17:16.760 --> 17:18.839
I had just failed an interview

17:18.920 --> 17:20.240
and came here to drink beer.

17:24.359 --> 17:25.960
Drinking beer in the cold wind…

17:30.080 --> 17:31.160
It must've been tough, huh?

17:33.960 --> 17:35.360
It was at first,

17:36.040 --> 17:39.320
but then you left me a book
and a set of makeup.

17:39.400 --> 17:40.680
After that, it wasn't.

17:42.080 --> 17:43.800
I never got to say thank you.

17:44.400 --> 17:46.560
So, now… thank you.

17:52.280 --> 17:54.200
If I had known it was you that day,

17:56.200 --> 17:57.200
I would've…

17:57.800 --> 17:58.800
If you had known it was me,

17:58.880 --> 18:01.120
you would've gladly taken the beer, right?

18:06.200 --> 18:07.040
No.

18:08.600 --> 18:09.560
No?

18:10.200 --> 18:11.160
Then what?

18:34.480 --> 18:37.160
My phone! Stop the thief!

18:37.240 --> 18:40.520
Stop the thief! My phone!

18:40.600 --> 18:42.800
Don't run! My phone!

18:43.560 --> 18:44.640
- Don't run!
- Stop!

18:44.720 --> 18:46.200
Stop right there!

18:47.040 --> 18:48.240
- Stop!
- My phone!

18:48.320 --> 18:49.320
Watch out!

19:12.400 --> 19:13.800
- Get up.
- Let's go.

19:14.920 --> 19:16.840
- Here's your phone.
- Thank you, thank you.

19:16.920 --> 19:19.000
Didn't expect you to be
so quick on your feet.

19:19.080 --> 19:21.040
- Well, I'll head off.
- Thank you.

19:39.880 --> 19:40.880
Um…

19:41.560 --> 19:43.040
How about…

19:44.680 --> 19:46.120
we continue?

19:53.040 --> 19:53.880
Continue what?

20:24.800 --> 20:25.800
Thank you.

20:27.360 --> 20:28.240
Thank me?

20:29.520 --> 20:30.800
For what?

20:33.040 --> 20:35.880
I've always felt that our products
are missing something.

20:38.280 --> 20:39.600
I feel the same way.

20:40.600 --> 20:43.720
Like they're missing that…

20:45.680 --> 20:46.640
Final touch.

20:46.720 --> 20:48.600
Yes, the finishing touch.

20:49.440 --> 20:50.320
You thought of it?

20:51.680 --> 20:54.120
Seeing you, it suddenly clicked.
I thought of it.

20:56.440 --> 20:57.880
Is it related to me?

20:58.680 --> 20:59.560
What is it?

21:01.680 --> 21:02.560
It's a secret for now.

21:07.760 --> 21:10.200
You just said you wanted to thank me.

21:11.560 --> 21:12.600
How do you plan to thank me?

22:12.440 --> 22:19.080
SOMETHING LIKE AN AUTOBIOGRAPHY

22:50.320 --> 22:52.680
FALLING CHESTNUT

22:55.880 --> 22:56.880
SUO

23:01.440 --> 23:02.920
PLUM DYE

23:11.200 --> 23:12.240
CHINESE REDBUD

23:18.920 --> 23:20.800
PLUM DYE

23:50.680 --> 23:52.960
RESULTS

24:11.680 --> 24:13.880
RESULTS: SKIN TONE - LIGHT YELLOW

24:14.880 --> 24:17.560
SIREN

24:17.640 --> 24:19.080
PEONY

24:20.440 --> 24:22.840
PEACH BLOSSOM

24:22.920 --> 24:24.120
QUEEN

24:34.160 --> 24:36.840
Is this the finishing touch
to our products?

24:37.920 --> 24:39.880
- What is it?
- Open it and see.

24:47.160 --> 24:48.000
Cleansing balm?

24:51.680 --> 24:53.880
I love seeing you
all dressed up and made up,

24:54.640 --> 24:57.040
but I love your real,

24:57.120 --> 24:58.400
bare face even more.

25:02.480 --> 25:03.600
I get it.

25:05.080 --> 25:08.560
No matter how we dress ourselves up
during the day,

25:08.640 --> 25:12.360
we have to accept and love
our true selves.

25:12.440 --> 25:14.800
Only by facing our real selves

25:14.880 --> 25:16.680
can we truly enjoy life

25:16.760 --> 25:18.200
and embrace beauty.

25:20.280 --> 25:22.040
I hope this cleansing balm

25:22.640 --> 25:24.720
can give our customers
a refreshing cleanse

25:24.800 --> 25:26.760
at the end of the day,

25:27.720 --> 25:29.920
returning to their true selves,

25:30.760 --> 25:33.560
letting go of everything.

25:58.520 --> 25:59.920
Is everyone ready?

26:00.600 --> 26:01.680
Ready!

26:01.760 --> 26:02.720
Let's go!

26:02.800 --> 26:04.280
Let's go!

26:06.680 --> 26:07.560
- Welcome!
- Wow!

26:07.640 --> 26:08.680
- Welcome!
- Welcome!

26:08.760 --> 26:10.280
Come in. Take a look over here.

26:10.360 --> 26:12.000
Take a look.

26:47.760 --> 26:51.880
CLOTHING & ACCESSORIES

26:51.960 --> 26:53.960
- How about this one?
- Cute.

26:54.680 --> 26:57.520
- It is, right?
- But what if it's a boy?

26:58.120 --> 26:58.960
You're right.

27:00.320 --> 27:03.000
But it's best to buy
a lot for both boys and girls.

27:03.880 --> 27:04.920
How about this one?

27:05.000 --> 27:05.960
Okay, let's get this.

27:07.040 --> 27:09.560
They say not to buy too many baby clothes.

27:09.640 --> 27:12.080
Babies grow so fast, changing every day.

27:12.160 --> 27:13.560
They can't wear all of them.

27:13.640 --> 27:16.120
It's fine, there's Chengcheng too.

27:17.120 --> 27:18.240
Chengcheng?

27:19.640 --> 27:21.200
If your child can't wear it,

27:21.760 --> 27:23.200
Chengcheng's child can.

27:23.840 --> 27:24.720
This one…

27:29.400 --> 27:31.400
This one's adorable. What do you think?

27:37.200 --> 27:39.440
Who's that person? Do you know her?

27:41.680 --> 27:42.880
Gu Yu's mom.

27:48.760 --> 27:51.920
Should we sneak away
and come back tomorrow?

27:53.200 --> 27:54.160
No need.

27:54.920 --> 27:56.200
Let's…

28:02.480 --> 28:03.320
go say hello.

28:05.680 --> 28:07.240
Okay. Let's go.

28:13.240 --> 28:14.080
Auntie!

28:16.440 --> 28:17.280
Yuan!

28:18.480 --> 28:19.760
What a coincidence!

28:19.840 --> 28:22.000
- You're here too?
- We're…

28:22.080 --> 28:23.760
Yes, for baby stuff.

28:24.960 --> 28:26.400
- And this is…?
- Godmother.

28:28.200 --> 28:30.400
- Hello, hello!
- Hello, hello!

28:30.480 --> 28:33.120
Though she calls me "Auntie",
I'm actually her godmother.

28:35.040 --> 28:37.520
Yuan is like a daughter to me.

28:38.240 --> 28:39.320
That's so nice.

28:40.640 --> 28:41.480
Uh…

28:45.160 --> 28:46.600
Well, you two go ahead and shop.

28:46.680 --> 28:48.840
I'll go take a look over there.

28:49.920 --> 28:50.880
Auntie,

28:51.440 --> 28:53.720
if you're not busy,

28:54.560 --> 28:55.960
why don't we shop together?

28:58.320 --> 28:59.280
Sure!

29:00.800 --> 29:02.560
We're all here for baby stuff anyway.

29:03.280 --> 29:04.600
- Right, right.
- Exactly, exactly.

29:04.680 --> 29:06.200
Come on. Let's go together.

29:06.800 --> 29:08.120
- Look!
- Over there.

29:08.200 --> 29:11.480
There are some cute little clothes.

29:15.720 --> 29:17.000
How are you going to thank me?

29:21.360 --> 29:23.520
I'll cover all your baby's essentials.

29:23.600 --> 29:25.400
MATERNITY & BABY PRODUCT MARKET

29:26.040 --> 29:27.040
Just kidding!

29:27.680 --> 29:28.520
What do you want?

29:32.440 --> 29:33.840
I want Yuan to be happy.

29:40.840 --> 29:42.080
I'll work hard for that.

29:42.920 --> 29:44.640
I also want to be happy myself.

29:48.720 --> 29:50.120
Did you know?

29:50.200 --> 29:52.920
In Chinese, "happiness" is symmetrical,

29:54.320 --> 29:56.360
like two people standing side by side.

29:56.920 --> 29:57.920
That's the meaning of it.

29:59.920 --> 30:01.720
I've remembered everything you've said.

30:04.840 --> 30:05.680
I'm leaving now.

30:08.120 --> 30:10.760
- It seems like we only need one of these.
- No, no, no.

30:10.840 --> 30:12.640
Take them all, take them all.

30:12.720 --> 30:16.040
When the baby is as beautiful as Yuan…

30:42.520 --> 30:44.240
Okay, let's start.

31:28.480 --> 31:30.040
Are you going camping?

31:30.120 --> 31:31.520
Aren't you working overtime this weekend?

31:32.240 --> 31:34.720
Try it out first. So, I'll be familiar
with it when we go out.

31:36.640 --> 31:38.280
Looks pretty good.

31:39.760 --> 31:41.640
Want to take a look inside?

31:42.560 --> 31:43.400
Sure.

32:05.160 --> 32:08.600
I have a gift for you.

32:11.200 --> 32:12.520
Is this…?

32:16.720 --> 32:18.160
Su Miao's SIM card,

32:18.240 --> 32:19.480
Fang Jin's SIM card,

32:19.560 --> 32:20.600
and Quan Shengtang's SIM card.

32:29.240 --> 32:30.800
Did you check the messages?

32:32.880 --> 32:33.720
No.

32:36.440 --> 32:39.560
Did you send them messages
after they died?

32:43.200 --> 32:47.000
They're different versions of you, right?

32:48.360 --> 32:49.800
If I send them messages,

32:50.880 --> 32:52.320
it's just like talking to you.

32:57.760 --> 32:59.160
Take it.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.640
When you want me to see it,

33:01.200 --> 33:02.440
let's check it together.

33:05.080 --> 33:05.920
Okay.

33:08.600 --> 33:09.440
I…

33:12.280 --> 33:13.480
I also prepared a gift for you.

33:14.880 --> 33:16.120
What gift?

33:32.400 --> 33:35.160
Earlier… you said
it looked pretty good, right?

33:36.160 --> 33:38.840
What I meant was
this tent looked pretty good.

33:38.920 --> 33:40.160
It probably cost a lot.

33:40.240 --> 33:42.080
You knew it wasn't set up properly?

33:42.800 --> 33:44.200
Then why did you still come in?

33:44.920 --> 33:46.960
I thought it would hold up
for an hour or so.

33:47.040 --> 33:48.840
We just need to get out in time.

33:48.920 --> 33:50.320
I didn't expect…

33:56.400 --> 33:58.760
Here, give me your hand.

34:09.320 --> 34:11.360
What did you say you wanted to give me?

34:19.480 --> 34:20.960
Never mind. Let's clean up first.

34:21.840 --> 34:23.080
I'll handle it.

34:46.560 --> 34:47.639
What's wrong?

34:52.320 --> 34:53.159
Nothing.

34:53.920 --> 34:55.120
Let's eat first.

35:06.200 --> 35:08.080
Did you find what you were looking for?

35:11.920 --> 35:12.760
I did.

35:20.200 --> 35:21.680
It's right where it's supposed to be.

35:26.320 --> 35:28.560
When the tent collapsed,
it fell right on me.

35:29.080 --> 35:30.640
I secretly tried it on,

35:30.720 --> 35:32.040
and it fits pretty well.

35:34.720 --> 35:36.800
Why did you prepare a ring for me?

35:39.720 --> 35:43.000
Last time when I proposed to you,
you were hidden by the filter.

35:43.800 --> 35:44.680
I couldn't see you.

35:47.520 --> 35:49.120
I wanted to ask you face to face.

36:00.800 --> 36:01.920
Tang Qi,

36:02.880 --> 36:04.840
will you spend
the rest of your life with me?

37:12.200 --> 37:13.040
I will.

37:19.560 --> 37:20.600
Me too.

38:57.080 --> 38:59.360
Sis, isn't it time to throw the bouquet?

39:00.120 --> 39:00.960
I'm ready.

39:01.680 --> 39:02.960
Is everyone ready?

39:03.040 --> 39:04.240
Come on, come on.

39:04.320 --> 39:06.400
Ms. Su, what a coincidence, we meet again.

39:06.480 --> 39:07.320
Look at us today.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.600
We are in almost the same color.

39:10.240 --> 39:11.760
We attend the same wedding,

39:11.840 --> 39:13.360
and we still run into each other.

39:13.440 --> 39:14.720
What a coincidence!

39:15.400 --> 39:16.560
Yes, yes, yes!

39:17.080 --> 39:18.880
Sis, hurry up!
Get ready, or it'll be gone.

39:18.960 --> 39:20.440
- I… I don't want it!
- Hurry.

39:20.520 --> 39:21.360
- I don't want it!
- Over here!

39:21.440 --> 39:22.680
Ready?

39:22.760 --> 39:24.040
Here, Cheng, three!

39:25.560 --> 39:26.760
Here, Cheng, here, here!

39:26.840 --> 39:29.040
One, two, three!

39:29.120 --> 39:30.120
Grab it!

39:31.280 --> 39:32.320
Hey!

39:34.400 --> 39:35.480
I'll throw it this time.

39:36.080 --> 39:37.000
Here we go. One…

39:37.080 --> 39:38.520
- I don't want it, really!
- Two…

39:38.600 --> 39:39.880
Three!

39:40.560 --> 39:42.720
Are you done yet? Hurry up!

39:42.800 --> 39:45.920
This time it's real. Everyone ready?

39:46.600 --> 39:48.440
Throw it over there, over there!

39:50.120 --> 39:53.120
Three, two, one…

40:09.560 --> 40:12.840
Mr. Gu. Your desperation to get married
is obvious to everyone!

40:13.440 --> 40:15.600
You're a lawyer,
but your word choice is so off.

40:15.680 --> 40:18.040
It's because I love Yuan
that I want to get married.

40:18.720 --> 40:22.080
You should say love for her is obvious.

40:25.280 --> 40:27.160
Sis, I never thought I'd see the day

40:27.240 --> 40:28.840
you lost a war of words!

40:38.920 --> 40:41.720
Tang Qi, what should you call me now?

40:44.960 --> 40:46.040
Sister.

40:46.720 --> 40:47.920
Good.

40:48.600 --> 40:50.000
If I can't bully you,

40:50.080 --> 40:52.240
can't I bully your weakness?

40:52.840 --> 40:54.160
This is a wedding.

40:54.240 --> 40:55.480
She's right.

40:56.560 --> 40:58.280
Everyone, listen up!

40:58.360 --> 41:00.120
Since the atmosphere is so lively,

41:00.200 --> 41:03.320
let's move on to the next activity.

41:03.400 --> 41:04.640
A game session.

41:08.560 --> 41:09.840
Our first game

41:09.920 --> 41:12.400
is arm wrestling
between the bride and groom!

41:14.240 --> 41:15.600
Arm wrestling?

41:16.200 --> 41:17.680
Arm… wrestling?

41:17.760 --> 41:20.600
Listen carefully.
The winner of this game gets a reward,

41:20.680 --> 41:23.920
but the loser gets a punishment.

41:28.200 --> 41:30.000
Well, isn't this…

41:30.080 --> 41:32.200
obviously forcing me to be a gentleman?

41:37.240 --> 41:39.160
Go, Chengcheng! Go, Chengcheng!

41:39.240 --> 41:44.440
- Go, go, go!
- Go, go, go!

41:44.520 --> 41:48.680
- Go, Chengcheng! Go, Chengcheng!
- Go, go, go!

41:48.760 --> 41:53.840
- Go, Chengcheng! Go, Chengcheng!
- Go, go, go!

41:53.920 --> 41:56.800
- Go, go, go!
- Go, go, go!

41:56.880 --> 41:58.200
Down!

42:04.080 --> 42:05.040
Impressive!

42:05.120 --> 42:07.040
Everyone, listen up!

42:07.120 --> 42:08.280
I completely didn't expect this.

42:08.360 --> 42:10.760
Let me announce the reward and punishment.

42:10.840 --> 42:13.840
The winning side gets
to kiss the losing side.

42:16.800 --> 42:18.240
What kind of reward is that?

42:18.320 --> 42:20.680
The groom's favorite reward!
Don't believe me?

42:20.760 --> 42:22.680
- Mr. Tang, do you like it?
- I do.

42:22.760 --> 42:23.840
See?

42:24.880 --> 42:27.880
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

42:27.960 --> 42:31.800
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

42:34.080 --> 42:35.560
What… What kind of kiss is this?

42:35.640 --> 42:36.480
Come on, you…

42:36.560 --> 42:37.880
A pure goodnight kiss?

42:39.080 --> 42:40.120
A real kiss!

42:40.200 --> 42:42.320
- Yes, yes, a real kiss!
- Yes.

42:42.400 --> 42:47.280
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

42:47.360 --> 42:52.600
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

44:13.360 --> 44:14.840
Time passes.

44:15.760 --> 44:17.840
When we look back at the past,

44:18.640 --> 44:19.920
we see moments in life

44:20.560 --> 44:22.440
being recorded,

44:23.640 --> 44:27.080
cherished, and remembered.

44:28.760 --> 44:31.920
The most touching part
isn't how beautiful we were,

44:33.080 --> 44:34.480
how perfect we were,

44:36.080 --> 44:37.680
or how young we were.

44:38.960 --> 44:42.360
But that we were real.

44:43.560 --> 44:45.120
We were truly living.

44:46.080 --> 44:47.400
There were highlights,

44:48.080 --> 44:49.560
dark moments,

44:51.440 --> 44:52.840
beautiful moments,

44:53.520 --> 44:55.200
and messy moments.

44:57.680 --> 45:00.920
All these moments come together
to form our memories,

45:01.720 --> 45:04.760
creating a life that's uniquely ours.

45:46.360 --> 45:51.080
THIS STORY IS DEDICATED
TO THE ORDINARY YOU AND ME
